"progressivement dans cet espace. Aucun résultat administratif n’est promis : "
"les décisions relèvent des autorités compétentes."
msgstr ""
"Detailed sheets on regular pathways to Italy will be published progressively "
"in this area. No administrative outcome is promised: decisions rest with the "
"competent authorities."

