"organismes partenaires : langue italienne, connaissance de la vie en Italie, "
"compétences utiles au parcours envisagé."
msgstr ""
"Before departure, vocational and civic-language training pathways may be "
"organised in the country of origin with partner bodies: Italian language, "
"knowledge of life in Italy, skills useful for the intended pathway."

