msgstr "Submit a proposal"

#: .\templates\forum\governance\commission_detail.html .\templates\forum\governance\participation.html
msgid "Jusqu’au"
msgstr "Until"

#: .\templates\forum\governance\commission_detail.html
msgid "La composition indique les organisations siégeant aujourd’hui, leur catégorie et la période de leur mandat. Elle ne comporte aucune coordonnée : le Forum n’est pas un répertoire de contacts."
msgstr ""
"The composition states the organisations sitting today, their category and "
"the period of their mandate. It contains no contact details: the Forum is "
"not a directory of contacts."

#: .\templates\forum\governance\commission_detail.html
msgid "Les membres et leur mandat"
msgstr "The members and their mandate"

#: .\templates\forum\governance\commission_detail.html
msgid "Les projets issus de la commission"
msgstr "The projects arising from the commission"

#: .\templates\forum\governance\commission_detail.html
msgid "Les propositions de la commission"
msgstr "The proposals of the commission"

#: .\templates\forum\governance\commission_detail.html
msgid "Les tables thématiques"
msgstr "The thematic round tables"

#: .\templates\forum\governance\commission_detail.html
msgid "Organisations siégeant dans la commission, leur qualité et la période de leur mandat"
msgstr ""
"Organisations sitting in the commission, their capacity and the period of "
"their mandate"

#: .\templates\forum\governance\commission_detail.html .\templates\forum\governance\participation.html .\templates\selection\partials\responsible.html
msgid "Qualité"
msgstr "Capacity"

#: .\templates\forum\governance\commission_detail.html .\templates\forum\governance\projects.html .\templates\forum\governance\proposal_detail.html
